---
import type { WeeklyReport } from "@bowen-hub/contracts";
import { pct } from "@bowen-hub/ui/format";

interface Props {
  report: WeeklyReport;
}
const { report } = Astro.props;
const labels: Record<string, string> = {
  CONFIRMED: "已确认",
  NOT_CONFIRMED: "未确认",
  INCONCLUSIVE: "证据不足",
  PENDING: "待结算",
};
---
<article><p class="eyebrow">五个交易日的结构复核 · {report.date}</p><h2 class="editorial-title">{report.title}</h2><p>{report.sentence}</p><nav aria-label="下载周报"><a href={`/weekly/${report.date}.md`}>Markdown →</a> · <a href={`/weekly/${report.date}.json`}>JSON →</a></nav>
<section><h2>上周判断验证</h2><p>结算 {report.settledCount} 条 · 确认 {report.previousJudgmentVerification.confirmedCount} · 未确认 {report.researchErrorCount} · 证据不足 {report.inconclusiveCount} · 到期未结算 {report.previousJudgmentVerification.unsettledDueCount}</p>{report.previousJudgmentVerification.items.map(x=><details><summary>{x.title} · {labels[x.result]}</summary><p>{x.resultNote}</p></details>)}</section>
<section><h2>真正改变结构的三件事</h2>{report.threeStructuralChanges.map(x=><article><h3>{x.name} · {x.judgment}</h3><p>变化：{pct(x.change)}</p><p>反证：{x.counter}</p></article>)}</section>
<section><h2>持续、反复与转弱</h2><p>方向数据覆盖 {report.lifecycle.directionCoverageDays}/{report.lifecycle.windowDays} 天。</p><ul>{report.lifecycle.persistentDirections.map(x=><li>{x.name} · 前三出现 {x.top3Appearances} 次</li>)}{report.lifecycle.oscillatingDirections.map(x=><li>{x.name} · 正负切换 {x.signChanges} 次 · 最新 {pct(x.latestRelative)}</li>)}</ul><p>最新弱势方向：{report.lifecycle.latestWeakDirections?.join('、')??'数据未就绪'}</p></section>
<section><h2>Research Error</h2><p>仅计未确认，证据不足单列。</p>{report.researchErrors.items.length===0?<p>本期没有未确认假设。</p>:report.researchErrors.items.map(x=><article><h3>{x.title}</h3><p>{x.reason}</p></article>)}{report.researchErrors.unsettledDue.map(x=><p>到期未结算：{x.title} · {x.resultNote}</p>)}</section>
<section><h2>下周只验证三件事</h2>{report.nextWeekQuestions.map(x=>x?<article><h3>{x.question}</h3><p>确认：{x.confirm}</p><p>失效：{x.invalidate}</p></article>:<p>方向数据未就绪，方向问题暂缺。</p>)}</section>
<section><h2>数据与方法</h2><p>交易日：{report.sessions.join(' · ')}</p><p>缺口：{report.dataAndMethodHealth.missing.join('、')||'无'}</p><p>{report.dataAndMethodHealth.boundary}</p></section>
</article>
<style>section{padding-block:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}details{padding:.8rem 0}summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px}</style>
